# Real credentials — must never end up baked into an image layer.
.local/
.env
.env.local

node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
.turbo

# .git is intentionally NOT excluded — the builder stage reads the current
# commit SHA from it (see Dockerfile's VERSION.txt step, apps/web/src/lib/
# update-check.ts) to power the in-app update checker. Multi-stage builds
# mean this never actually lands in the final runtime image regardless —
# only what's explicitly COPY'd into the `runner` stage does.

# apps/cli's own real-credential test files (see apps/cli/README.md)
apps/cli/.local/
